    title: "The device in PCIe Slot %1 is SRIOV capable but is installed in a slot that does not support SRIOV",
    symptom: "The device in PCIe Slot %1 is single root input/output virtualization (SRIOV) capable but is installed in a slot that does not support SRIOV.",
