    title: "Uncorrectable Memory Error",
    symptom: "Uncorrectable Memory Error: The failed memory module could not be determined.",
    cause: "An uncorrectable error occurred on a DIMM or NVDIMM.",
    action: "Check the enclosure status and resolve the indicated issues.\n\n1. Review the Integrated Management Log for another event that might indicate which DIMM has failed.\n2. If you are unable to determine which DIMM has failed, or, if the issue persists, create an HPE Support Case. \n 1. Verify the component is either under warranty or contract. Go to \nhttps://support.hpe.com/hpesc/public/home, and then click **Warranty Status**.\n\nThis enables HPE to ship replacement parts directly to you once a failure has been confirmed. For specific information about customer replaceable parts, refer to the product maintenance and service guide.\n\n 2. Under **Support Cases**, click **Access Cases**, and then create a support case. \nHPE Support will contact you.",
