    action: "**Caution**: Do not operate the server for long periods with the access panel open or removed. Operating the server in this manner results in improper airflow and improper cooling that can lead to thermal damage.\n\n1. Verify that the access panel was intentionally removed and that the server is secure.\n2. At the earliest opportunity, install the access panel.",
