    action: "Install iLO Advanced license to enable Core Boost Technology. The iLO Advanced license was not detected by the BIOS. Installing the required LO license will resolve the issue.\n\nFor more information see the HPE iLO Licensing Guide at http://www.hpe.com/support/iLOLicenseGuide-en",
