    action: "Replace the cache module.\n\n1. Create an HPE support case.\n2. Verify the component is either under warranty or contract. Go to the: \nCustomer Self Repair website.\n\nThis enables HPE to ship replacement parts directly to you once a failure has been confirmed. For specific information about customer replaceable parts, refer to the product maintenance and service guide.\n\n3. Create a support case at: http://www.hpe.com/support/hpesc. \nHPE Support will contact you.\n\n4. Replace the cache module charging circuit. For more information, see your system documentation",
