    action: "1. Reseat the card in the slot.\n2. Update to the latest version of NIC firmware.\n\nFor more information, see the _NIC issues flowchart_ in the _Troubleshooting Guide for HPE ProLiant Gen10 servers_ at http://www.hpe.com/info/enterprise/docs.",
