    symptom: "Server health LED is set to warning.",
    cause: "There is insufficient power in the frame or enclosure to allow the server to power on at this time. This could be the result of the power supply configuration in the frame or enclosure.",
    action: "See HPE OneView (Synergy compute modules) or the Onboard Administrator (c-Class servers) for additional information. This issue might clear when the other servers complete POST.",
    severity: "critical",
